WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.140
The first private lander, leaning.

00:02.926 --> 00:10.857
It came down on a slope of about 12 degrees, broke some of its landing gear, and came to rest leaning at 30 degrees, still working.

00:11.483 --> 00:20.846
Nothing had landed nearer a pole until the same company's next lander, IM-2, reached 84.8 degrees south in March 2025.
